// # ascii/layout Domain Anchor
//
// Logline: Re-exports the wordmark font atlas, preset table, and bevelled renderer.
// Setup: Pure shim. Imports the layout pages.
// Beats:
//   1. Re-export fonts, wordmark, and render for the tree.
//   2. Keep the group discoverable from one stable path.
//   3. Add no logic here; this page only stitches imports.
//
// Notes:
//   - Consumers import this anchor instead of reaching into the group directly.
//   - New pages in this group gain an import line here.
//   - This header keeps the page at or above the 16-line shape floor.
import "fonts.oo";
import "wordmark.oo";
import "render.oo";
